<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-11T06:51:27.880Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:51:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-linked drones attacked the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, halting production and cutting about 2.8 GW of power, while Iraqi forces responded with airstrikes on three suspected militants and a tunnel in Kirkuk's Zghaitun Valley. Militia leaders are seeking Chinese and Russian air defenses, prompting deployment of air defenses to fifty locations. Baghdad reopened the Sheeb border crossing with Iran after a three-week closure and agreed to withdraw Turkish forces from the Zilkan base by the end of 2026. Former Iraqi MP Ahmed al-Alwani was found dead in a Beirut apartment. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFB6ZEFrRTFCdzBsUHhxSGVwZlAwNHhkX3hKZjZEWjdqNE5DMWJvZmdRNXpORHlxYmlkOUZXVnhkSzlyYkg3dVIwWHZiMzFxTDBpYkJUejlYSTZRUWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPdzVILXVQb1pXa053QmhuN0NQSjRRcEZRMjV1dGZBTXp3VWRSOG1wMlFnTjlfaFVxN0dqTllrUjhmbUs3MEY1ZktaZE9EUUg1cHQ0Z0ZwMDFyUHc4S1REdTRYUzR4bDJrbnFfQnRzZlRxR2txRUJXSGlhYlBTdG5JeGlIUlk5WEd4bDBWcy1mVzNlaGVyT1dtVVFTNjJ3NDk1SVNHSXkzVXBHN3BNMU1QWnJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQRjlSd2FrSzRhU0tEbmROLW4tVVFKdVM2WnU5dzgwb1RJRkpTTUM4RV9ES3Q0cTZFSmFYaXZKalpUbVhZcDEyckNsWC1JV3E4QXlsVXBxSVM5RHlXZ1Z2Z21jMU1HMzg4Q1RxNm9sQ3JmWGsyUDBPQURDdVpxYzFscXJiOXNxSFl4MDZVTU0xQ3NGYTJoeUFGSWhKZTV1bjdGUWJlSTNueDRwbGdzMlZXZVpJUDA3c2Q5RVlndS1zU3JaeDJzd1BzeDNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOenJxZUszbXhxT2U2eDBSMUFibTROQ0o4X05fVUdaX3A3MDFvd